Osmo Action 6 support: live view, Normal 10-bit and D-Log M color with the official LUT, and an APERTURE control in place of FOCUS that shows the live f-number and sets the aperture mode. Action 6 has not been checked on a real camera yet, so reports are welcome. Also new: experimental Multiview for up to four Pocket or Nano cameras, and live video no longer stops shortly after connecting.
